+#!/usr/bin/env python3
+"""Compose the real Main launch authorization/duplication code on Linux.
+
+The complete production launch-session include, challenge issuer, fatal native
+observation helper, and portable challenge/grant/wire/admission headers execute
+against synthetic native seams.
+State, pipe observations, handles, startup custody, store, hashes, entropy and
+device-signature decisions are fixtures, never cryptographic or Windows proof.
